## Cause
The spec expected the pairing screen to name the node by its address; autobyteus-433 (ba3ba5b23e, "show a node's name, never its address, on the phone") made it show the QR's serverName or "AutoByteus node". It fails on its own, every run; no file this ticket changes is on the pairing screen's path (MobilePairingBootstrap.vue -> nodeNameOrDefault(payload.serverName)). The cause was established by reading, not by a base run. Fixed in the spec only.

